"To enable full Plack speed, initialize SWAP, and ensure peak catalog performance, rebooting the system now is strongly recommended.\n\nCredentials have been saved to /root/credenciais_koha.txt.\n\nDo you want to reboot the server immediately?")" 15 76; then
